    'tl.support.s02_li4': 'Konfig\u00fcrat\u00f6r, teklifler, sipar\u0131\u015fler ve PDF d\u0131\u015fa aktarma sorular\u0131',
    'tl.support.s02_li5': 'Hata bildirimleri ve \u00f6zellik istekleri',
    'tl.support.s03_title': 'Yazmadan \u00f6nce',
    'tl.support.s03_tip1': 'Google Play veya App Store \u00fczerinden TankLogic\u2019in en son s\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fcn\u00fc kulland\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 do\u011frulay\u0131n.',
    'tl.support.s03_tip2': 'Cihaz\u0131n\u0131z\u0131n aktif bir internet ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 oldu\u011fundan emin olun.',
